1
00:00:18,957 --> 00:00:21,782
Joyboy...

2
00:00:21,782 --> 00:00:24,478
...has returned!

3
00:00:33,086 --> 00:00:34,999
What happened...

4
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:36,174
...to me?

5
00:00:42,478 --> 00:00:45,565
How come I can still stand up?

6
00:00:49,391 --> 00:00:51,391
I might've lost...

7
00:00:51,391 --> 00:00:53,782
...but now it's gettin' fun!

8
00:00:56,435 --> 00:00:57,826
Joyboy?!

9
00:00:57,826 --> 00:00:58,999
Does he mean Luffy?!

10
00:00:59,913 --> 00:01:03,087
Is that what Zunesha said?!

11
00:01:11,826 --> 00:01:12,999
You've come to...

12
00:01:13,782 --> 00:01:15,347
Gentleman Pirate!
lond

13
00:01:16,347 --> 00:01:17,217
Luffy?!

14
00:01:22,608 --> 00:01:23,869
Eh?

15
00:01:23,869 --> 00:01:26,043
Is that the Straw Hat Man?

16
00:01:26,043 --> 00:01:27,608
Straw Hat?!

17
00:01:27,608 --> 00:01:28,521
Hey!

18
00:01:29,391 --> 00:01:31,391
He's still kickin', yessir!

19
00:01:31,478 --> 00:01:33,347
Luffy's not dead?!

20
00:01:33,347 --> 00:01:35,956
Big Bro's still alive?!

21
00:01:37,435 --> 00:01:39,608
Thank goodness!

22
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:47,913
Sacrificing one of our best agents...

23
00:01:52,130 --> 00:01:57,826
Suppose there was some possible future where
we would beg for this outcome?

24
00:01:58,739 --> 00:02:02,739
Eliminating dangerous variables
is always best.

25
00:02:03,826 --> 00:02:05,912
Since its inception,

26
00:02:05,913 --> 00:02:11,478
the World Government has sought after
the Gum-Gum Fruit...

27
00:02:11,478 --> 00:02:16,652
And yet, not once has it come
into our possession...

28
00:02:16,957 --> 00:02:19,043
Not even once,
in eight hundred years!

29
00:02:19,521 --> 00:02:21,043
It is as if...

30
00:02:21,521 --> 00:02:26,695
...the Devil Fruit evades us, no?

31
00:02:27,391 --> 00:02:29,869
Not entirely implausible.

32
00:02:30,608 --> 00:02:34,347
Zoan-type Devil Fruits
have wills of their own.

33
00:02:34,826 --> 00:02:39,130
Furthermore, that Devil Fruit
bears the name of a god.

34
00:02:39,130 --> 00:02:43,434
The Gum-Gum Fruit
goes by another name...

35
00:02:43,435 --> 00:02:47,304
The Zoan-type, Human-Human Fruit,

36
00:02:47,304 --> 00:02:50,043
Mythical Type, Model:

37
00:02:52,000 --> 00:02:53,435
Nika.

38
00:02:55,174 --> 00:03:00,782
They say his body takes on
the very properties of rubber itself.

39
00:03:00,826 --> 00:03:04,217
He fights as he fancies,

40
00:03:04,217 --> 00:03:07,130
and brings smiles to
the faces of the people.

41
00:03:07,652 --> 00:03:10,261
The Warrior of Liberation...

42
00:03:10,957 --> 00:03:12,522
Also known as...

43
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:16,348
Nika, the Sun God!

44
00:03:20,347 --> 00:03:25,608
Awakening the power is said to bestow upon
the user's body even greater physical strength...

45
00:03:25,608 --> 00:03:28,130
...and freedom.

46
00:03:30,652 --> 00:03:35,478
It is said that in all the world,
there is no power more...

47
00:03:36,347 --> 00:03:38,130
co.ridiculous.

48
00:03:50,957 --> 00:03:52,565
Komurasaki!

49
00:03:52,565 --> 00:03:54,651
Hi-Hiyori!

50
00:03:56,347 --> 00:04:00,521
Y-Y-You know,
I really did like Oden, after all!

51
00:04:02,000 --> 00:04:03,652
Think about it, won't you?!

52
00:04:03,652 --> 00:04:07,087
I was exploited by Kaido!

53
00:04:11,478 --> 00:04:13,608
Let's run away from this,
you and I!

54
00:04:13,608 --> 00:04:16,260
Just remove this nail from me...

55
00:04:17,782 --> 00:04:21,608
Pray tell who would lend
you their ear now!

56
00:04:26,478 --> 00:04:28,043
My father...

57
00:04:28,826 --> 00:04:31,043
...kept his word to you,

58
00:04:31,739 --> 00:04:32,869
did he not?

59
00:04:33,435 --> 00:04:36,000
He believed that you and Kaido...

60
00:04:36,478 --> 00:04:38,695
...would set free the Land of Wano,

61
00:04:40,826 --> 00:04:42,956
and so he spent five years...

62
00:04:42,957 --> 00:04:45,304
...making a complete fool of himself!

63
00:04:47,435 --> 00:04:49,782
And not once did he
complain of it to his family!

64
00:04:56,174 --> 00:04:58,391
My father kept his word!

65
00:05:01,043 --> 00:05:04,738
He took you at your word:
you would set his people free...

66
00:05:06,086 --> 00:05:08,260
And so he withstood
an hour of torture by boiling!

67
00:05:10,347 --> 00:05:13,173
His body, cooked alive
by the scorching oil!

68
00:05:13,652 --> 00:05:17,000
Forever and ever,
always bearing a smile upon his face...

69
00:05:18,826 --> 00:05:21,173
Alas, the nation whole
was taken hostage,

70
00:05:22,086 --> 00:05:26,347
and he alone its burden bore...
O, Father, how you suffered so!

71
00:05:26,652 --> 00:05:28,739
How hellish it must have been!

72
00:05:38,782 --> 00:05:41,217
What is the matter, Hiyori?

73
00:05:42,260 --> 00:05:45,912
Father, are you fine with
people speaking ill of you?

74
00:05:45,913 --> 00:05:48,304
Aye, 'tis just as well.

75
00:05:48,304 --> 00:05:49,130
Why?

76
00:05:49,130 --> 00:05:52,043
Because I have all of you!

77
00:05:52,043 --> 00:05:56,129
Really?
Then, I'll always be with you!

78
00:06:00,608 --> 00:06:04,869
Weeell... Oden was a
most impressive samurai!

79
00:06:04,869 --> 00:06:06,652
Deserving of praise, even!

80
00:06:06,652 --> 00:06:11,304
As Shogun, I would be pleased
to reward your father!

81
00:06:17,000 --> 00:06:18,565
My name is...

82
00:06:19,217 --> 00:06:20,739
...Kozuki Hiyori!

83
00:06:22,869 --> 00:06:25,608
You will hold your tongue,
insolent knave!

84
00:06:29,696 --> 00:06:33,217
Even as I starved and
wore little more than tatters...

85
00:06:33,217 --> 00:06:36,826
I strove to live up
to my father's name!

86
00:06:37,739 --> 00:06:42,652
There was never a single day
when you were the true Shogun!

87
00:06:44,217 --> 00:06:46,260
You are as foolish
as you are uncouth!

88
00:06:47,174 --> 00:06:51,478
And the more you act as such,
the more lives will have been shattered in vain!

89
00:06:53,260 --> 00:06:57,564
N-Now, now! No closer!
Don't do anything rash!

90
00:06:58,130 --> 00:07:01,956
Vengeance-seeking is
quite antiquated, you know!

91
00:07:02,347 --> 00:07:07,217
Even if you kill me,
you can't defeat Kaido!

92
00:07:07,608 --> 00:07:09,912
Orochi-sama...

93
00:07:11,304 --> 00:07:14,782
I have failed...

94
00:07:14,782 --> 00:07:17,912
You!
Is that you, Kanjuro?!

95
00:07:17,913 --> 00:07:20,739
This is... as far as I go.

96
00:07:20,739 --> 00:07:22,739
You're just in time!

97
00:07:23,174 --> 00:07:25,565
I grant you a new stage!

98
00:07:25,565 --> 00:07:28,391
Turn that woman to ash!

99
00:07:28,391 --> 00:07:30,739
Charge!

100
00:07:34,435 --> 00:07:38,869
The failure of a woman
that endured hardship for twenty years!

101
00:07:38,869 --> 00:07:41,999
What a tragicomedy!

102
00:07:42,000 --> 00:07:43,174
Do you see?!

103
00:07:43,521 --> 00:07:48,173
Vestige of the Kozuki, Hiyori!

104
00:07:48,174 --> 00:07:51,174
This... This is the luck...

105
00:07:51,174 --> 00:07:53,869
of the strong!

106
00:07:57,130 --> 00:08:00,130
Orochi-sama...

107
00:08:01,869 --> 00:08:05,043
Not toward me!
Don't come toward me!

108
00:08:08,913 --> 00:08:11,260
Kanjuro, you damned fool!

109
00:08:11,260 --> 00:08:13,738
Hiyori!
Save me!

110
00:08:14,347 --> 00:08:16,912
Oww hothothot owhotow!

111
00:08:19,826 --> 00:08:22,695
The Dawn... will surely come.

112
00:08:23,652 --> 00:08:25,043
Our clan, the Kozuki...

113
00:08:25,435 --> 00:08:28,130
...always keeps their word!

114
00:08:34,000 --> 00:08:37,913
I can do everything
I've ever wanted!

115
00:08:39,260 --> 00:08:43,043
And I think I can get
a little more fightin' in!

116
00:08:43,913 --> 00:08:47,522
Man, my heartbeat sounds funny!

117
00:08:53,086 --> 00:08:58,434
I've hit my peak!

118
00:08:59,391 --> 00:09:00,739
This is it!

119
00:09:02,478 --> 00:09:04,913
Gear 5!

120
00:09:12,521 --> 00:09:14,608
Hey, what's wrong?!

121
00:09:14,608 --> 00:09:16,565
Someone's Color of the Conqueror?!

122
00:09:16,565 --> 00:09:18,738
Where's it coming from?!

123
00:09:19,217 --> 00:09:21,608
Hey, the bunch of ya!

124
00:09:25,739 --> 00:09:28,609
What's that on the roof?

125
00:09:32,652 --> 00:09:34,261
Huuuh?!

126
00:09:47,260 --> 00:09:48,390
Kaido-san?!

127
00:09:49,696 --> 00:09:51,304
Straw Hat?!

128
00:09:51,304 --> 00:09:53,695
Is that Luffy?!

129
00:10:05,608 --> 00:10:07,304
Musclin', musclin'!

130
00:10:07,304 --> 00:10:08,390
Muscles!

131
00:10:17,086 --> 00:10:18,216
Upsy-daisy!

132
00:11:19,043 --> 00:11:21,477
Straw Hat...!

133
00:11:21,478 --> 00:11:23,521
So you're alive, huh!

134
00:11:23,608 --> 00:11:25,912
Gotta thank you!

135
00:11:35,174 --> 00:11:36,000
Heh?

136
00:11:37,347 --> 00:11:38,434
Huh?!

137
00:11:40,130 --> 00:11:41,130
Hwuuuuh?!

138
00:11:43,347 --> 00:11:44,782
Blast Breath!

139
00:12:09,869 --> 00:12:12,434
Get 'im!

140
00:12:56,347 --> 00:12:59,651
I feel bad about what
that moron did earlier...

141
00:13:05,174 --> 00:13:09,087
I didn't want to win like that.

142
00:13:11,086 --> 00:13:12,521
Dun worry 'bout it.

143
00:13:14,652 --> 00:13:16,130
Let's settle this!

144
00:13:36,304 --> 00:13:40,608
I thought for sure you were dead.

145
00:13:42,478 --> 00:13:43,782
Me too!

146
00:13:46,565 --> 00:13:50,043
Seeing as how the rubber power's
affecting other things...

147
00:13:50,043 --> 00:13:54,129
It's probably safe to say
your Paramythia's awakened, yeah?

148
00:13:54,696 --> 00:13:57,435
But something
about it's a little off...

149
00:13:58,174 --> 00:14:00,347
That kind of
full-body transformation...

150
00:14:00,347 --> 00:14:04,173
...is something you
only see with Zoans!

151
00:14:16,260 --> 00:14:19,130
So dark! So cramped!

152
00:14:22,217 --> 00:14:24,391
Ya big jerk!

153
00:14:25,435 --> 00:14:27,174
Muscly muscles...

154
00:14:27,174 --> 00:14:29,391
...power!

155
00:14:51,869 --> 00:14:54,217
Ya-hoo!

156
00:14:58,347 --> 00:15:02,651
I'm a shootin' star!
Just call me Shooting Luffytaro!

157
00:15:02,652 --> 00:15:05,217
Enjoy, go!

158
00:15:12,696 --> 00:15:14,782
Gum-Gum...

159
00:15:14,782 --> 00:15:16,695
...Balloon!

160
00:15:19,435 --> 00:15:21,956
Stahgp mehssgin'
'roundg ing ere...!

161
00:15:25,347 --> 00:15:26,304
Eh?!

162
00:15:26,304 --> 00:15:28,390
Huuuuh?!

163
00:15:28,435 --> 00:15:29,695
What is that?!

164
00:15:29,696 --> 00:15:31,782
What is going on?!

165
00:15:31,782 --> 00:15:32,826
Haven't the slightest!

166
00:15:32,826 --> 00:15:35,086
Kaido became quite rotund!

167
00:15:37,739 --> 00:15:39,435
Did he have a form like that?

168
00:15:47,391 --> 00:15:50,130
Dammit, what's going on with me?!

169
00:15:50,217 --> 00:15:53,043
My body ain't made of rubber!

170
00:15:56,696 --> 00:15:59,522
This's a riot!

171
00:16:00,608 --> 00:16:02,565
There's a couple of lights!

172
00:16:04,304 --> 00:16:06,695
The fun's just gettin' started!

173
00:16:17,347 --> 00:16:19,956
Gum-Gum...

174
00:16:20,000 --> 00:16:22,304
...Escape Rocket!

175
00:17:09,347 --> 00:17:10,564
Luffy?!

176
00:17:11,000 --> 00:17:13,957
Gum-Gum...

177
00:17:14,826 --> 00:17:17,347
...Gigant!

178
00:17:17,347 --> 00:17:19,608
Whaaaa

179
00:17:20,696 --> 00:17:22,478
Whaaaa?!

180
00:17:31,696 --> 00:17:32,130
Whuh?!

181
00:17:35,174 --> 00:17:37,347
Who is that?!

182
00:17:37,347 --> 00:17:39,695
Why do I hear Luffy's voice
from up there?!

183
00:17:39,696 --> 00:17:42,087
Hueh?!
Is that Luffy?!

184
00:17:44,435 --> 00:17:45,782
Knock it off!

185
00:17:54,043 --> 00:17:56,564
Gum-Gum...

186
00:18:03,000 --> 00:18:04,652
...Jump Rope!

187
00:18:16,347 --> 00:18:18,434
Blast Breath!

188
00:18:19,608 --> 00:18:21,217
Eeeyowww!

189
00:18:26,782 --> 00:18:27,739
Now ya've done it!

190
00:18:45,347 --> 00:18:47,912
Straw Hat!

191
00:18:51,086 --> 00:18:53,390
Gum-Gum...

192
00:18:53,435 --> 00:18:55,087
Conqueror of Three Worlds:

193
00:19:01,130 --> 00:19:02,782
...Ragnaraku!

194
00:19:09,130 --> 00:19:11,260
That hoifits!

195
00:19:11,260 --> 00:19:12,260
Ohmygaaaahhh!

196
00:19:14,957 --> 00:19:17,783
Whaaaaaaaaaa?!

197
00:19:20,565 --> 00:19:23,825
Why the hell does
Straw Hat look like that?!

198
00:19:32,696 --> 00:19:35,435
Like something
right out of a comic strip...

199
00:19:38,435 --> 00:19:40,956
Ooh, yow...

200
00:19:46,782 --> 00:19:51,652
Very entertaining show you put on.
But, you've hit the wall, ain't ya?

201
00:19:51,652 --> 00:19:52,913
Ain't ya?

202
00:19:52,913 --> 00:19:55,870
You don't got what it takes
to knock me out!

203
00:19:59,782 --> 00:20:01,434
Shuddup!

204
00:20:03,217 --> 00:20:05,304
Who says I've hit the wall?!

205
00:20:24,086 --> 00:20:25,782
I'm pooped.

206
00:20:25,782 --> 00:20:27,173
Who the hell're you?!

207
00:20:37,435 --> 00:20:39,000
Oh, yeah...

208
00:20:39,000 --> 00:20:42,783
I was dyin' 'fore this...

209
00:20:43,217 --> 00:20:46,087
Man, this really
eats up my energy...

210
00:20:46,652 --> 00:20:49,000
Rest assured, you'll die knowing...

211
00:20:49,000 --> 00:20:52,957
...that someone'll pass down the story
of how the bunch of you fought.

212
00:20:53,957 --> 00:20:55,261
I dun...

213
00:20:55,826 --> 00:20:57,217
...need...

214
00:20:57,217 --> 00:20:58,913
....any of that!

215
00:21:02,913 --> 00:21:05,217
Once we die,

216
00:21:05,217 --> 00:21:06,956
all that's left of us is bones!

217
00:21:11,043 --> 00:21:12,912
He truly is Luffy!

218
00:21:12,913 --> 00:21:16,521
He did not appear to be himself,
owing to his hair and clothes turning white...

219
00:21:16,521 --> 00:21:17,565
However,

220
00:21:17,565 --> 00:21:20,869
his voice is fading away!

221
00:21:21,391 --> 00:21:24,521
This can't end...

222
00:21:24,521 --> 00:21:27,956
V
It can't end just yet, right?

223
00:21:27,957 --> 00:21:28,826
Momo!

224
00:21:30,000 --> 00:21:30,782
Mm!

225
00:21:30,782 --> 00:21:31,956
Tama!

226
00:21:35,086 --> 00:21:36,477
Kin'emon!

227
00:21:39,000 --> 00:21:40,217
Pedro!

228
00:21:45,304 --> 00:21:47,390
Careful,
or you're gonna die.

229
00:21:52,217 --> 00:21:57,608
Ya actually ink
I'm afraid o' that?!

230
00:22:05,608 --> 00:22:09,565
C'mon heart, hit that beat!

231
00:22:22,435 --> 00:22:23,913
Have it your way, then!

232
00:22:33,521 --> 00:22:36,043
Oh yeah, that's the sound!

233
00:22:39,000 --> 00:22:40,783
Look out, Luffy!

234
00:22:49,565 --> 00:22:50,521
Huuuuh!!

235
00:22:55,739 --> 00:22:58,130
Yowwieee!

236
00:23:32,739 --> 00:23:35,000
Just what could it all mean?!

237
00:23:35,000 --> 00:23:37,043
Turning white all over,

238
00:23:37,043 --> 00:23:39,390
coating himself in both
Armament and Conqueror Haki,

239
00:23:39,478 --> 00:23:43,608
affecting things other than himself with his powers,
and fighting so fast and loose...

240
00:23:43,608 --> 00:23:45,391
I've never seen anything like this!

241
00:23:45,478 --> 00:23:48,261
Right this way!
C'mon, follow me!

242
00:23:55,782 --> 00:23:58,912
Hey, that's a pretty neat attack!

243
00:23:59,000 --> 00:24:01,696
Gum-Gum Rightbackatcha!

244
00:24:17,260 --> 00:24:19,651
Playing games with kids is seriously...

245
00:24:20,304 --> 00:24:21,782
a pain in the ass!

246
00:24:24,869 --> 00:24:25,999
Three!

247
00:24:26,565 --> 00:24:27,391
Two!

248
00:24:28,826 --> 00:24:30,130
One!

249
00:24:31,130 --> 00:24:32,043
Zero!

250
00:25:05,130 --> 00:25:07,652
This's fun, don'cha think,

251
00:25:07,652 --> 00:25:09,565
Kaido?!

252
00:25:12,086 --> 00:25:15,782
This's pretty powerful, too!
And I get a kick outta it!

253
00:25:23,696 --> 00:25:25,478
I can't make up my mind...

254
00:25:26,000 --> 00:25:29,826
What do I call this attack?
"Gum-Gum" what?

255
00:25:32,043 --> 00:25:36,390
Gum-GumGum-Gum...

256
00:25:36,391 --> 00:25:39,956
Who the hell are you?

257
00:25:40,130 --> 00:25:40,913
Huh?

258
00:25:41,478 --> 00:25:43,652
I'm me!

259
00:25:51,782 --> 00:25:53,739
How long has it been...!

260
00:25:54,826 --> 00:25:57,912
This rhythm!
Joyboy!

261
00:25:59,130 --> 00:26:02,260
Say, Joyboy...

262
00:26:03,435 --> 00:26:06,608
It is as if you are actually here!

263
00:26:06,608 --> 00:26:08,478
How my heart dances!

264
00:26:10,739 --> 00:26:14,043
I sense this must be fate!

265
00:26:14,869 --> 00:26:19,043
I cannot help but place my faith in him!

266
00:26:19,391 --> 00:26:21,435
Who am I, you ask?

267
00:26:21,826 --> 00:26:24,086
Monkey D. Luffy!

268
00:26:24,086 --> 00:26:25,956
The man that's gonna best ya...

269
00:26:25,957 --> 00:26:29,609
...and become the Pirate King!

270
00:26:30,608 --> 00:26:36,738
CONTINULD

271
00:26:56,478 --> 00:26:59,348
"Time's up'

272
00:27:00,608 --> 00:27:03,999
Someone said again, with a laugh

273
00:27:04,435 --> 00:27:09,000
Fine then, hide-and-seek playtime...

274
00:27:09,565 --> 00:27:10,609
...is over

275
00:27:12,521 --> 00:27:15,869
Let's go, come on (We can see it soon)

276
00:27:15,913 --> 00:27:19,739
Let your heart beat out

277
00:27:20,652 --> 00:27:23,956
and things will change (We can see it soon)

278
00:27:24,217 --> 00:27:28,217
Grow strong, you have time

279
00:27:28,478 --> 00:27:29,087
Lift up that dream

280
00:27:29,347 --> 00:27:36,217
The overflowing loneliness can't sustain me alone

281
00:27:36,347 --> 00:27:40,217
We were so free in our younger days

282
00:27:40,347 --> 00:27:43,521
What a dumb dream

283
00:27:43,869 --> 00:27:44,869
...to live

284
00:27:45,086 --> 00:27:48,738
Shining a light on uncharted ways

285
00:27:49,000 --> 00:27:52,870
Get on our feet and try

286
00:27:52,957 --> 00:27:56,871
Let's see the ends of the world together

287
00:27:57,000 --> 00:28:01,000
Together, we can go and fly